<title>USA: Sierra Health backs $2.40 1997 estimate.</title>
<headline>Sierra Health backs $2.40 1997 estimate.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sierra Health Services Inc Chairman Anthony Marlon said on Thursday he was comfortable with a 1997 estimate of $2.40 per share and he expected the company's medical loss ratio to be 77 percent at the end of the year.</p>
<p>&quot;We are comfortable with $2.40 for the upcoming year,&quot; Marlon told the Dillon Read analysts meeting, &quot;we seem to be on track to meet that.&quot;</p>
</text>
